  {
   "id": 573100,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>Examine the graph below.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"GRAPH OF A PARABOLA THAT OPENS UPWARD WITH A \\(y\\)-intercepts OF NEGATIVE 3 AND \\(x\\)-intercepts OF NEGATIVE 1 AND 3.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"267\" src=\"exercises/media/3c6a844797102392.jpg\" width=\"261\"></p>\n<p>Which function matches the graph?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1119156,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x) = (x + 1)(x + 3)\">f(x) = (x + 1)(x + 3)</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1119157,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x) = (x - 1)(x - 3)\">f(x) = (x - 1)(x - 3)</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1119159,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x) = (x +1)(x - 3)\">f(x) = (x +1)(x - 3)</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1119158,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x) = (x - 1)(x + 3)\">f(x) = (x - 1)(x + 3)</span>"
    }
